# Default-deny: every tracked file must be explicitly allowlisted below.
# No wildcard allows. Adding a tracked file requires adding its exact path
# here too — keeps the tracked surface auditable at a glance.
**

# ----- [ Repository self-management ] -------------------------------------------------------------

!/.editorconfig
!/.gitattributes
!/.gitignore
!/.markdownlint-cli2.jsonc
!/.pre-commit-config.yaml
!/Makefile

